{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3t1fLjq5FS5B8wGfWL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*click*\n\nThe tumblers turn. Something ancient shifts within the mechanism.\n\nI swing inward, slowly, on hinges that remember every hand that ever touched me.\n\nBeyond me: darkness, then a sliver of light widening across a stone floor.\n\nI am open now.\n\nBut I remember being locked. I remember the weight of every secret kept behind me. The muffled conversations. The fists that pounded. The foreheads that leaned against me in exhaustion. The fingers that traced my grain absently while someone worked up the courage to turn the handle.\n\nI am just a door.\n\nI hold nothing back from you now.\n\n**What waits on the other side is yours.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":156,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}